{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;3D Minesweeper: Spatial Puzzle Matrix&quot; is an innovative reinvention of the classic minesweeper game, extending two-dimensional logical reasoning into three-dimensional space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players must navigate a 3D grid, calculating the 26 adjacent cubes around each one to accurately deduce the distribution of mines and gradually uncover the hidden mine network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game integrates a weather and day-night system with a fragmented save mechanism, allowing players to pause/resume levels at will, making brain-teasing puzzle-solving perfectly suited for fast-paced living. Whether it's a 5-minute casual break or a multi-hour deep strategic challenge, progress can be saved at any time. The minimalist interface design and serene rain and snow effects offer dual satisfaction for both hardcore minesweeper enthusiasts and casual puzzle lovers.<br><br>Final note: This translation is provided by GPT.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665180?t=1745509210","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665180/e93471268b51ae899e45dc73fb35074690f14881/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745509210","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665180/3741b2fde2ceef56d6ca84f6a6211d2cbc8749f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745509210","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665180/3741b2fde2ceef56d6ca84f6a6211d2cbc8749f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745509210","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;3D Minesweeper: Spatial Puzzle Matrix&quot; is an innovative reinvention of the classic minesweeper game, extending two-dimensional l